*\n* **Bone:** *(Blank)*\n* **FULL BAJU:** YES\n* **Fabric Supervisor:** *(Not assigned yet)*\n\n---\n\nAgar aapko is lot ya cutting schedule ke baare mein kuch aur poochna ho, toh zaroor batayein!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-14 12:56:03', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
