w with Stitching.\n\n7. **Folding Department**\n   - *Status:* Scheduled post-stitching.\n\n8. **Elastic Department**\n   - *Status:* Pending / In-line.\n\n9. **Packing & Barcode Department**\n   - **Sheet:** `Issues / Barcodes`\n   - **Date:** 2026-04-13\n   - **Supervisor:** Mdsaqib\n   - **Quantity:** 640 Pcs\n   - **Status:** [✓] Packed (21/04/26) | Barcodes Generated: `LOT-11600A`, `LOT-11600B`\n\nBoliye boss, is lot ke baare mein aur kuch check karna hai?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-17 11:17:17', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
