tent.com/d/1UdF3A0z8g8jSsL15ZlcGkPaPp3sSm4Rw)\n\n**2. Lot 69015** (Job Order: `JO-1388` | Style: **LOWER** | Fabric: **HARISH PRINT CEMO 123** | Qty: **1 ROLLS**)\n\n![Lot 69015 - LOWER (LOWER)](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1TcE2z9y7f7iRrK14YkbFjOzOo2rRl3Qv)\n\n**3. Lot 69016** (Job Order: `JO-1389` | Style: **LOWER** | Fabric: **HARISH PRINT CEMO 123** | Qty: **1 ROLLS**)\n\n![Lot 69016 - LOWER (LOWER)](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1SbD1y8x6e6hQqJ13XjaEiNyNn1qQk2Pu)\n\n**4. Lot 69017** (Job Order: `JO-1390` | Style: **LOWER** | Fabric: **HARISH PRINT CEMO 123** | Qty: **1 ROLLS**)\n\n![Lot 69017 - LOWER (LOWER)](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1RaC0x7w5d5gPpI12WiZDhMxMm0pPj1Ot)\n\n**5. Lot 69018** (Job Order: `JO-1391` | Style: **LOWER** | Fabric: **HARISH PRINT CEMO 123** | Qty: **1 ROLLS**)\n\n![Lot 69018 - LOWER (LOWER)](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1Q9Bw6v4c4fOoH11VhYCGwLwLl9oOi0Ns)\n\n---\nSir, agar kisi aur party (jaise DC, DB, BB, ya Mohit Hosiery) ke uncut lots ki photos bhi chahiye ho toh turant batayein!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-18 05:52:25', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
