BONDING**)\n\n![Lot 11870](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1QG6vcENcnFcQpmT44_0Ve_ECaZmC7j_A)\n\n💡 **Lot Verify Karne Ke Liye:**\nAgar aapka article inme se kisi design se match karta hai toh aap uska Lot Number bata sakte hain, ya phir is article ke **Cutting Slip** ya **Bundle Ticket** ki photo upload karein!', NULL, NULL, '{\"imageGallery\":[{\"url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1ktMrFRC7WronZEOA9Q6_Ibs2FSRvyxQF\",\"isCut\":false,\"party\":\"Mohit Hosiery\",\"style\":\"LOWER\",\"title\":\"Lot #12040 - Mohit Hosiery (LOWER)\",\"fabric\":\"M.m fleece (micky)\",\"shades\":\"BLACK (OLIVE B.GREEN) [4], BLACK (GREY) [4], COFFEE (BEIGE) [4], D.GRAY (BLACK) [4], TAN (OFF WHITE) [4], NAVY (TAN) [4], OFF WHITE   HALF (NAVY) [2]\",\"garment\":\"Track Suit Lower\",\"jobOrder\":\"JO-1904\",\"lotNumber\":\"12040\"},{\"url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1wXeyI_nzjByU6KSYNcXNzqIjgu-4CTH5\",\"isCut\":false,\"party\":\"Mohit Hosiery\",\"style\":\"LOWER\",\"title\":\"Lot #12006 - Mohit Hosiery (LOWER)\",\"fabric\":\"FANCY CLOTH MICKEY TT\",\"shades\":\"B.GREEN (OFF WHITE) [4], BRICK (L.GREY M.M) [4], BLACK (BRICK) [4], D.CAMEL (D.OLIVE) [4], GREY (OFF WHITE) [4], L.GREY M.M MICKY (D.OLIVE) [4]\",\"garment\":\"LOWER\",\"jobOrder\":\"JO-1808\",\"lotNumber\":\"12006\"},{\"url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1DdggFLXvtBfco5JWjp3QRzOg-fWVoqBu\",\"isCut\":false,\"party\":\"Mohit Hosiery\",\"style\":\"LOWER\",\"title\":\"Lot #11856 - Mohit Hosiery (LOWER)\",\"fabric\":\"MH FLEECE\",\"shades\":\"BLACK [2], BLACK [2], 15% [2], OFF WHITE [2], NAVY [2], L.BEIGE [2]\",\"garment\":\"LOWER\",\"jobOrder\":\"JO-1453\",\"lotNumber\":\"11856\"},{\"url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1Se4bS-YU2xWht6ww4R5r7jU0wZbQIhid\",\"isCut\":false,\"party\":\"Mohit Hosiery\",\"style\":\"LOWER\",\"title\":\"Lot #11869 - Mohit Hosiery (LOWER)\",\"fabric\":\"ROCKWOOD\",\"shades\":\"BLACK (BLACK(PRINTING WALA CHART)) [4], SILVER (GREY) [4], FAWN (FAWN) [4], OFF WHITE (STONE) [4], CHOCOLATE (FAWN) [4], BLACK (GREY) [4]\",\"garment\":\"LOWER\",\"jobOrder\":\"JO-1515\",\"lotNumber\":\"11869\"},{\"url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1_H8A0f25cscoWjXqnNKwpR6Nm6ro6xvB\",\"isCut\":false,\"party\":\"Mohit Hosiery\",\"style\":\"LOWER\",\"title\":\"Lot #12011 - Mohit Hosiery (LOWER)\",\"fabric\":\"Fancy cloth georgia\",\"shades\":\"BLACK [3], WHITE [3], 15% [3], FAWN [3], ROYAL [3], DEEP GREY [3]\",\"garment\":\"TS - UPPER\",\"jobOrder\":\"JO-1816\",\"lotNumber\":\"12011\"},{\"url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1QG6vcENcnFcQpmT44_0Ve_ECaZmC7j_A\",\"isCut\":false,\"party\":\"Mohit Hosiery\",\"style\":\"LOWER\",\"title\":\"Lot #11870 - Mohit Hosiery (LOWER)\",\"fabric\":\"HARRIS PRINT BONDING\",\"shades\":\"BLACK [4], GREY [4], FAWN [4], TAN [4], BLACK [4], STONE [4]\",\"garment\":\"LOWER\",\"jobOrder\":\"JO-1516\",\"lotNumber\":\"11870\"}]}', NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-19 07:21:32', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
INSERT INTO `chat_messages` (`id`, `channel_id`, `sender_id`, `sender_name`, `sender_role`, `sender_avatar`, `text`, `image_url`, `audio_url`, `file_attachment`, `reactions`, `task_attachment`, `is_ai`, `created_at`, `message_type`, `task_id`, `reply_to_message_id`, `status`, `is_deleted`) VALUES ('msg-ai-1792398864898', 'chan-ai', 'pulse-bot', 'PulseBot AI (Gemini)', 'AI Assistant', '🤖', 'Hello ji! Haan ji, bataiye... Kya aapko upar diye gaye list mein se apna Lot number mil gaya, ya aap iska **Cutting Slip / Bundle Ticket** share karna chahenge? \n\nAap mujhe **Party ka naam** (jaise Mohit Hosiery, SS, etc.) ya **Fabric/Color** ki details bhi bata sakte hain, main turant search karke exact Lot number nikal dunga!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-19 08:34:24', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
INSERT INTO `chat_messages` (`id`, `channel_id`, `sender_id`, `sender_name`, `sender_role`, `sender_avatar`, `text`, `image_url`, `audio_url`, `file_attachment`, `reactions`, `task_attachment`, `is_ai`, `created_at`, `message_type`, `task_id`, `reply_to_message_id`, `status`, `is_deleted`) VALUES ('msg-ai-1792398892963', 'chan-ai', 'pulse-bot', 'PulseBot AI (Gemini)', 'AI Assistant', '🤖', 'Hello ji! Verified Factory Data ke mutabiq **Party BB** ke total 179 lots mein se abhi **4 lots Uncut (Cutting Pending)** hain. \n\nIn sabhi **4 Uncut Lots** ki complete list aur specifications niche di gayi hain:\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Party BB - Uncut / Pending Lots (4 Lots):\n\n1. **Lot #62048**\n   * **Job Order:** JO-564\n   * **Style:** T-SHIRT R/N (DROPSHOULDER ROUND NECK)\n   * **Fabric:** LYCRA SINKER\n   * **Quantity:** 1 ROLLS\n   * **Embroidery:** BHM\n\n2. **Lot #62088**\n   * **Job Order:** JO-1233\n   * **Style:** SWEATSHIRT (ROUNDNECK)\n   * **Fabric:** MH FLEECE\n   * **Quantity:** 1 ROLLS\n   * **Embroidery:** NA\n\n3. **Lot #62167**\n   * **Job Order:** JO-1609\n   * **Style:** S/L JACKET (FULL ZIPPER COLLAR)\n   * **Fabric:** BUBBLE TT LEATHER\n   * **Quantity:** 22 SETS\n   * **Embroidery:** NA\n\n4. **Lot #62176**\n   * **Job Order:** JO-1722\n   * **Style:** JACKET (FULL ZIPPER COLLAR)\n   * **Fabric:** CROCODILE LEATHER\n   * **Quantity:** 15 SETS\n   * **Embroidery:** NA\n\n---\n\nAgar aapko in uncut lots ki cutting floor allocation ya kisi aur specific order ki details chahiye, toh mujhe zaroor bataiye!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-19 08:34:52', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
INSERT INTO `chat_messages` (`id`, `channel_id`, `sender_id`, `sender_name`, `sender_role`, `sender_avatar`, `text`, `image_url`, `audio_url`, `file_attachment`, `reactions`, `task_attachment`, `is_ai`, `created_at`, `message_type`, `task_id`, `reply_to_message_id`, `status`, `is_deleted`) VALUES ('msg-ai-1792400469061', 'general', 'pulse-bot', 'PulseBot AI (Gemini)', 'AI Assistant', '🤖', 'Regarding **Lot 62048**, please be advised that this order is **officially CANCELLED**. It is not in the cutting queue, nor is it pending production.\n\nPer our Verified Factory Data, here is the audit trail for this lot:\n\n*   **Lot Number:** 62048\n*   **Job Order:** JO-564\n*   **Party Name:** BB\n*   **Style:** DROPSHOULDER ROUND NECK\n*   **Status:** ❌ **CANCELLED**\n\n### Department Audit Trail:\n\n1.  **Job Order Master**\n    *   **Date:** 2026-01-12\n    *   **Supervisor:** EA (Order Referred By Mohit Goyal)\n    *   **Status:** ❌ ORDER CANCELLED\n    *   **Details:** Party: BB | Cancelled (Reason: DELAY)\n\n2.  **Cutting Department**\n    *   **Date:** 2026-09-01T14:28:06.660Z\n    *   **Supervisor:** Order Cancelled (PARAS)\n    *   **Status:** ⛔ CANCELLED (Not in Cutting Queue)\n    *   **Details:** Lot cancelled before cutting. Reason: DELAY\n\n3.  **Stitching Department**\n    *   **Date:** Pending / Not initiated on production floor\n    *   **Supervisor:** -\n    *   **Status:** ⛔ CANCELLED\n    *   **Details:** Order cancelled before stitching\n\n4.  **Order Cancellation**\n    *   **Date:** 2026-09-01T14:28:06.660Z\n    *   **Supervisor:** PARAS\n    *   **Status:** ❌ CANCELLED\n    *   **Details:** Reason: DELAY • Approved By: MOHIT SIR\n\nThis lot was formally closed due to delays and is not active on the production floor. Please let me know if you require information on any other active lots.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-19 09:01:09', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
INSERT INTO `chat_messages` (`id`, `channel_id`, `sender_id`, `sender_name`, `sender_role`, `sender_avatar`, `text`, `image_url`, `audio_url`, `file_attachment`, `reactions`, `task_attachment`, `is_ai`, `created_at`, `message_type`, `task_id`, `reply_to_message_id`, `status`, `is_deleted`) VALUES ('msg-ai-1792400491767', 'general', 'pulse-bot', 'PulseBot AI (Gemini)', 'AI Assistant', '🤖', 'Party **BB** ke cutting pending / uncut lots ki status report niche di gayi hai:\n\n### 📊 Summary for Party **BB**:\n* **Total Master Orders:** 179 Lots\n* **Cut Complete:** 175 Lots\n* **Cancelled Orders:** 4 Lots (Lot 62048, Lot 62088, Lot 62167, Lot 62176)\n* **Cutting Pending (Uncut):** **0 Lots**\n\n---\n\n### ✂️ Uncut / Cutting Pending Lots: **0**\n\nOfficial Production History ke mutabiq, Party **BB** ke paas filhaal **0 uncut lots** baaki hain. Sabhi active orders ki cutting poori ho chuki hai. \n\n*(Note: Total 4 cancelled orders ko uncut category mein include nahi kiya gaya hai kyunki yeh orders completely cancel ho chuke hain.)*\n\nAgar aapko kisi specific cut lot ya kisi doosre party ke status ke baare mein detail chahiye, toh kripya batayein!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-19 09:01:31', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
INSERT INTO `chat_messages` (`id`, `channel_id`, `sender_id`, `sender_name`, `sender_role`, `sender_avatar`, `text`, `image_url`, `audio_url`, `file_attachment`, `reactions`, `task_attachment`, `is_ai`, `created_at`, `message_type`, `task_id`, `reply_to_message_id`, `status`, `is_deleted`) VALUES ('msg-ai-1792400512348', 'chan-ai', 'pulse-bot', 'PulseBot AI (Gemini)', 'AI Assistant', '🤖', 'Hello ji! Official Cancellation Records ke mutabiq, abhi tak total **110 Lots** cancel ho chuke hain.\n\nYahan kuch sample details hain jo aapko samajhne mein madad karengi ki ye lots kyun cancel hue:\n\n*   **Lot 11046:** Double Order ki wajah se (By: EA)\n*   **Lot 11102:** Fabric stock mein nahi tha (By: EA)\n*   **Lot 11134 & 11135:** Fabric stock mein nahi tha (By: Paras Referred from EA)\n*   **Lot 65002, 65008, 65009, & 65010:** Cutting mein delay hone ki wajah se (By: PARAS)\n\nAgar aapko kisi specific Job Order ya kisi particular party ke cancelled lots ki list chahiye, toh please mujhe **Job Order number** ya **Party ka naam** bataiye, main turant check karke aapko details de dunga!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-19 09:01:52', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
INSERT INTO `chat_messages` (`id`, `channel_id`, `sender_id`, `sender_name`, `sender_role`, `sender_avatar`, `text`, `image_url`, `audio_url`, `file_attachment`, `reactions`, `task_attachment`, `is_ai`, `created_at`, `message_type`, `task_id`, `reply_to_message_id`, `status`, `is_deleted`) VALUES ('msg-ai-1792400636091', 'chan-ai', 'pulse-bot', 'PulseBot AI (Gemini)', 'AI Assistant', '🤖', 'Hello ji!\n\nSabse pehle, main aapko batana chahunga ki ek AI text assistant hone ke kaaran main filhal **images/photos display ya send nahi kar sakta**. Lekin main aapko un cancelled lots ki saari **text details, reasons aur status** poori tarah provide kar sakta hoon.\n\nOfficial Cancellation Records ke mutabiq:\n* System mein total **110 Cancelled Lots** recorded hain.\n\nYahan kuch **sample cancelled lots** aur unke reasons diye gaye hain:\n\n* **Lot 11046:** Cancelled due to Double Order (By: EA)\n* **Lot 11102:** Cancelled - Fabric not in stock (By: EA)\n* **Lot 11134 & 11135:** Cancelled - Fabric not in stock (By: Paras Referred from EA)\n* **Lot 65002, 65008, 65009, & 65010:** Cancelled due to Delay of Cutting (By: PARAS)\n\nAgar aap kisi specific **Job Order (JO)** ya **Style** ke cancelled lots ki text details chahte hain, toh kripya mujhe Job Order number batayein, main turant record check karke bata dunga!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-19 09:03:56', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
