D\n   * **Details:** Complete Lot (Finished: 24 Aug 2026 10:44 AM)\n\n5. **Packing & Barcode Department**\n   * **Process Date:** 2026-08-20\n   * **Supervisor:** Chavinath\n   * **Quantity:** 260 Pcs\n   * **Status:** ✓ Packed (Barcode: LOT-61200A)\n   * **Details:** Barcodes: LOT-61200A\n\n---\nAgar aapko is lot ke baare mein koi aur additional details ya report chahiye, toh main zaroor madad karunga!', NULL, NULL, '{\"trackingData\":{\"brand\":\"OFFWHITE\",\"party\":\"SS\",\"style\":\"BOXY FIT\",\"fabric\":\"JOGGER TERRY\",\"stages\":[{\"pcs\":\"1 ROLLS\",\"date\":\"2026-05-15\",\"dept\":\"Job Order Master\",\"notes\":\"Party: SS | Style: BOXY FIT | Fabric: JOGGER TERRY\",\"status\":\"Order Registered\",\"stageName\":\"Order Initiation\",\"supervisor\":\"JAIN (Order Referred By Mohit Goyal)\"},{\"pcs\":\"260 Pcs\",\"date\":\"2026-07-10\",\"dept\":\"Cutting Department\",\"notes\":\"Cutting Completed & Verified\",\"status\":\"✓ CUT COMPLETED\",\"stageName\":\"Fabric Cutting\",\"supervisor\":\"-\"},{\"pcs\":\"260 Pcs\",\"date\":\"2026-07-14\",\"dept\":\"Embroidery Department\",\"notes\":\"Vendor: BHM | Details: POCKET, OTHER:BACK SIDE | Challan: CH-EMB-0885\",\"status\":\"✓ EMBROIDERY COMPLETED\",\"stageName\":\"Embroidery Processing\",\"supervisor\":\"BHM\"},{\"pcs\":\"260 Pcs\",\"date\":\"2026-07-25\",\"dept\":\"Stitching Department\",\"notes\":\"Complete Lot (Finished: 24 Aug 2026 10:44 AM)\",\"status\":\"✓ STITCHING COMPLETED\",\"stageName\":\"Garment Stitching\",\"supervisor\":\"MONU\",\"isCompleted\":true,\"latestWipRemarks\":\"Elastic working pending\"},{\"pcs\":\"260 Pcs\",\"date\":\"2026-08-20\",\"dept\":\"Packing & Barcode Department\",\"notes\":\"Barcodes: LOT-61200A\",\"status\":\"✓ Packed (Barcode: LOT-61200A)\",\"stageName\":\"Packing & Dispatch\",\"supervisor\":\"Chavinath\",\"isCompleted\":true}],\"garment\":\"LOWER\",\"lotNumber\":\"61200\",\"jobOrderNo\":\"JO-1179\",\"isCancelled\":false,\"cancelReason\":\"\",\"currentStage\":\"Production Completed\",\"designImageUrl\":\"http://localhost:5000/api/chat/image-proxy?id=1Gxw1LZt_BYLGoGLL_Geo2q-BdOHnW5Tw\",\"latestWipRemark\":null,\"overallProgress\":100,\"latestWipTimestamp\":null,\"isStitchingComplete\":true,\"stitchingSupervisor\":\"MONU\"},\"imageAttachment\":{\"url\":\"http://localhost:5000/api/chat/image-proxy?id=1Gxw1LZt_BYLGoGLL_Geo2q-BdOHnW5Tw\",\"title\":\"Lot 61200 - SS (LOWER / BOXY FIT)\",\"lotNumber\":\"61200\"}}', NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-29 05:17:09', 'text', NULL, NULL, 'sent', 0);
